    "detailed_description": "Become Wolf, a research staff member, and get to the &quot;place to return&quot;. This is an action game that can be played easily with only the mouse!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A classic single-player action game that takes you from a &quot;familiar room&quot; to a &quot;place to return to&quot;.<br></li><li>Easy to use, mouse-only controls!<br></li><li>Complete more than 50 highly challenging action scenes in a mysterious laboratory!</li></ul><br>The only actions used are &quot;Jump&quot; and &quot;Wall Stick&quot;. However, Wolf bounces around like a golf player!<br>Use the wall sticking and reflection from the wall to get through the highly challenging action scenes.<br>Even if you fail, you can recover instantly! Lead Wolf to the &quot;place to return&quot; while bouncing around in all directions!",
    "about_the_game": "Become Wolf, a research staff member, and get to the &quot;place to return&quot;. This is an action game that can be played easily with only the mouse!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A classic single-player action game that takes you from a &quot;familiar room&quot; to a &quot;place to return to&quot;.<br></li><li>Easy to use, mouse-only controls!<br></li><li>Complete more than 50 highly challenging action scenes in a mysterious laboratory!</li></ul><br>The only actions used are &quot;Jump&quot; and &quot;Wall Stick&quot;. However, Wolf bounces around like a golf player!<br>Use the wall sticking and reflection from the wall to get through the highly challenging action scenes.<br>Even if you fail, you can recover instantly! Lead Wolf to the &quot;place to return&quot; while bouncing around in all directions!",
    "short_description": "Become Wolf, a research staff member, and get to the &quot;place to return&quot;. This is an action game that can be played easily with only the mouse! Complete more than 50 highly challenging action scenes while repeatedly making mistakes!",
